  "evidencia": "Page: Paul Traub. Sentence: Paul R. Traub (born January 31, 1952, Brooklyn, New York) is an American lawyer, who specializes in business law, specifically bankruptcy, insolvency, and trial litigation.\nPage: Paul Traub. Sentence: He has participated in several large retail bankruptcies, among them Kmart, FAO Schwarz Inc., KB Toys Inc., Stage Stores, Office Max, and eToys.com.\nPage: Stage Stores. Sentence: Stage Stores, Inc. is a department store company specializing in retailing brand name apparel, accessories, cosmetics, footwear, and housewares throughout the United States.\nPage: Stage Stores. Sentence: The corporate office is located in Houston, Texas.",
