        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul R. Traub\n- Companies: Stage Stores, Kmart, FAO Schwarz Inc., KB Toys Inc., Office Max, eToys.com\n- Places: Brooklyn, New York, Houston, Texas, United States\n- Roles: American lawyer\n- Topics: business law, bankruptcy, insolvency, trial litigation, retail bankruptcies, department stores, retail apparel and housewares\n\nFacts:\n- Paul R. Traub was born on January 31, 1952, in Brooklyn, New York.\n- Paul R. Traub is an American lawyer who specializes in business law, specifically bankruptcy, insolvency, and trial litigation.\n- Paul R. Traub has participated in several large retail bankruptcies, including Kmart, FAO Schwarz Inc., KB Toys Inc., Stage Stores, Office Max, and eToys.com.\n- Stage Stores, Inc. is a department store company in the United States that specializes in brand name apparel, accessories, cosmetics, footwear, and housewares.\n- Stage Stores, Inc. has its corporate office in Houston, Texas.",
